      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I want to clarify our request. We ask splitting 22789 `Join` for the usages: one for joining a world instance and others for joining a group (see the images).\n\nAlso, toki pona requests this on the Crowdin comment issue. Please resolve it when this split request is complete.",
