  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-04-10T17:44:32.073Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "We (as Japanese) choose to translate \"Join\" differently depending on the context. For example, in the case of strings relating to the world will be \"入る\" or \"合流\", if not it will be \"参加\".\n\nFor now, the \"Join\" is used in Worlds and Groups. so, I would like to be able to add a string of \"Join\" for groups.",
